{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "93bbac39-09a9-8478-9b18-7210f5970b30",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T12:59:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonio N. Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing Authority, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Walter. Antonio Cabral. I'm a registered voter in Newport and I need to change my party affiliation. What's the process for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:54:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can walk you through it. Are you currently registered with a party, or unaffiliated?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:54:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Currently unaffiliated. I want to go Democrat. Well, I want to register with a party so I can vote in the primary."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:54:57-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. You'd fill out a voter registration form, the same one used for new registrations and for changes. You check the box for the party you want and update anything else that's different. You can submit it here at the office, mail it in, or do it through the state's online voter registration system if you have a Rhode Island license or ID."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:55:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online works. I've got my license. Is there a deadline on it? I know there's some cutoff before elections."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:55:31-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is. For any election, registration and affiliation changes have to be in a set number of days beforehand. Primaries also have their own rules about changing affiliation, so the timing is a little different there. The exact date for the next one is on the Secretary of State's election calendar, and I can look at what we have posted here too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:55:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, if you can pull that up. I'd rather not guess and miss it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:02-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, hold on just a moment. [pause] Okay, I'm looking at the calendar. Nothing is coming up in the next few weeks, so you have time. Once the next election is scheduled, the cutoff will be posted about a month ahead. If you do the change now, you'll be set well before it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So do it now, don't wait on the date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I'd recommend. Once it goes through, we'll update your record and you should get a new voter confirmation card in the mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long does the card take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a couple of weeks. If it hasn't shown up in about three, call us back and we'll check the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And I'm using my current address, no change there. Do I need to put anything about the last one? I was on base housing a few years back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, just your current residence. The form will ask for a previous address only if you've moved since you last registered. If your registration here is current, you can leave that blank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Sorry, I'm on the cell, can you hear me okay? I'm walking out of a building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll say, I called the state representative's office first, and that line was jammed. Sounded way busier than I expected for Christmas Eve. They sent me to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a lot of folks are trying to get things squared away before the holiday. We've had steady calls today too, though we close early this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I'm glad I got through. Anything I should have on hand when I fill it out online?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your Rhode Island license or state ID number, your date of birth, and the last four digits of your Social Security number. That's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Easy. Okay, and if the online one rejects me for some reason, I can just walk in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Come by City Hall during regular hours, ask for canvassing, and we'll give you the paper form. We can process it right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Do you need my number in case anything's off with the record?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you'd like to leave it, I can note it. It isn't required."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0169."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0169. And that's under Antonio Cabral, C-A-B-R-A-L?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Middle initial N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I've made a note. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that covers it. Thanks, Walter. Happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:59:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Cabral. Take care."
    }
  ],
